{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":176,"count":26,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L10-2-04\",\"痛\",\"痛\",\"痛\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"最近也有很多人肚子痛。","pinyin":"Zuìjìn yě yǒu hěn duō rén dùzi tòng.","english":"Many people have a stomachache as well.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-2-01","sourceFront":"咳嗽/咳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我咳嗽、頭痛，鼻子也不舒服。","pinyin":"Wǒ késou, tóu tòng, bízi yě bù shūfu.","english":"I have a cough and headache. Also my nose is uncomfortable.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-2-01","sourceFront":"咳嗽/咳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"a 疒(sickness) rests along a 甬(path) → every step feels 痛(painful)."},{"key":"[\"B1L15-1-07\",\"课文\",\"課文\",\"课文\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這課的課文很有意思，我很喜歡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-07","sourceFront":"課文","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L16-1-23\",\"雨\",\"雨\",\"雨\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"從昨天晚上到現在，已經下了十個小時的雨了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L16-1-23","sourceFront":"雨","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我今天本來想去看電影，後來下雨就沒去了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L16-2-02","sourceFront":"後來","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我們在逛夜市的時候，忽然下雨了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-02","sourceFront":"忽然","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我討厭下雨，因為出去玩很不方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-31","sourceFront":"討厭","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"雨停了，我們可以去公園野餐了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-2-17","sourceFront":"停","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們正在烤肉的時候，忽然下雨了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-13","sourceFront":"正在","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這條公路很危險，一下大雨，山上的石頭就會掉下來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-17","sourceFront":"下來","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"要不是下大雨，我們就去動物園玩了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-22","sourceFront":"要不是","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下了好幾天的大雨，不但到處淹水，連我家養的雞、鴨也淹死了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-17","sourceFront":"淹","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從這裡走路回家有一點兒距離，而且現在還下著大雨，我們還是搭計程車算了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-31","sourceFront":"距離","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"昨天晚上的風雨聲好可怕，讓我整個晚上都沒睡好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-42","sourceFront":"風雨聲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個地區是個危險地帶，因為經常一下雨就有石頭掉下來，有時候連路都會塌了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-06","sourceFront":"地帶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"東部山區一連下了好幾天的大雨，有些房子倒了，公路也塌了，造成不少意外。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-13","sourceFront":"山區","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次社區的中秋節活動，決定在戶外舉辦，萬一下雨了就搬到室內去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-09","sourceFront":"室內","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個城市一連下了五天的雨，造成很多地區淹水，三分之一的路不通了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-13","sourceFront":"之","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現在突然下起了大雨，我們的計畫被破壞了，恐怕今天所有的活動都必須重新安排。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-18","sourceFront":"重新","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"天空突然下起了大雨，我的衣服和頭髮都濕了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-20","sourceFront":"溼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們爬山爬到一半就起風了，過了幾分鐘就下起大雨來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-23","sourceFront":"起","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"外面風大雨大，媽媽只好把還沒乾的衣服收進來，掛在屋內。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-17","sourceFront":"內","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"前天的強烈颱風帶來了大雨，很多地方都淹水了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-18","sourceFront":"帶來","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"昨天棒球賽進行到一半時突然下起了大雨，雖然後來雨停了，但因為球場太溼，也無法繼續比賽了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-16","sourceFront":"進行","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今明兩天的天氣可能從晴天轉雨天，出門前記得帶傘。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-05","sourceFront":"轉","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"外面下著大雨，路很滑，請小心開車。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-27","sourceFront":"滑","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"窗外正下著大雨，我又沒帶傘，看來得在公司多留一會兒了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-29","sourceFront":"看來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次颱風可能帶來大量雨水，地形較低的地區應該多注意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-12","sourceFront":"大量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次颱風雨大風又強，大街上不少店家都關店休息。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-04","sourceFront":"大街","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"市長宣布明天因為颱風的風雨太大，不上班、不上課。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-02","sourceFront":"宣布","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"爬山時如果碰到大雨就應避免繼續前進，以免發生危險。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-20","sourceFront":"前進","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下過雨後道路比較滑，開車時速度別太快。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-06","sourceFront":"道路","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"昨天電視臺的氣象報告說今天會下雨，果然一大早就下起雨來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-52","sourceFront":"果然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"一(one) 冂(frame) holds 丷(horns) and 八(eight) drops → the pouring 雨(rain)."},{"key":"[\"B2L02-1-16\",\"丢\",\"丟\",\"丢\",\"Vpt/Vp\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"來台灣學中文以前，我把一些舊書丟了。聽說你的車子丟了。是在哪裡丟的？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-16","sourceFront":"丟","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那位客人的錢包丟了，非常著急。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-17","sourceFront":"著急","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"你要把這些小說都丟了？太可惜了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-31","sourceFront":"可惜","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我去義大利旅行的時候，不小心把護照弄丟了，我擔心死了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-13","sourceFront":"死","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的錢包丟了，裡面有護照、 信用卡，這件事很要緊，得馬上告訴警察","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-17","sourceFront":"要緊","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:糟了，我不小心把隨身碟弄丟了，資料都存在裡面。 B:這下子我們的期末報告都白做了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-20","sourceFront":"這下子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"要維持社區良好的生活品質，就要從不亂丟垃圾、減少家庭噪音做起。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-13","sourceFront":"維持","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我剛剛忘了把垃圾拿出去丟，還好你提醒我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-11","sourceFront":"提醒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司交給你的支票記得要收好，別弄丟了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-46","sourceFront":"支票","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到國外旅遊時身上別攜帶太多鈔票，否則錢丟了就麻煩了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-18","sourceFront":"否則","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家超商食品賣不完就丟掉的作法，不但白白浪費食物，回收處理的成本也增加了，長期下來十分浪費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-26","sourceFront":"浪費","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"用過一面的紙張別急著丟，另一面也可以用。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-04","sourceFront":"紙張","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到外面做了丟人的事，自己和家人也會覺得丟臉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-28","sourceFront":"丟人","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"接待客戶是有技巧的，弄不好可能會丟了生意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-29","sourceFront":"接待","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"假如擔心弄丟重要的資料，可複製一份存在電腦裡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-17","sourceFront":"複製","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L02-2-19\",\"不用\",\"不用\",\"不用\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"住在這裡很安全，你不用擔心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-2-19","sourceFront":"不用","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我可以自己回家，你不用陪我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-05","sourceFront":"陪","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個社區很安全，不用擔心小偷來偷東西。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-05","sourceFront":"偷","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"像衝浪、滑雪那樣的戶外活動，又刺激又好玩，不用說，絕對能吸引青少年。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-08","sourceFront":"不用說","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"姊姊：下個星期就要大學考試了，你怎麼不用功念書，反而天天出去玩？ 弟弟：妳別管我，這是我自己的事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-14","sourceFront":"管","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"假如東西買回家後常擺著不用，那樣的消費就是不必要的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-03","sourceFront":"消費","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L03-2-13\",\"國外\",\"國外\",\"国外\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"到國外生活以前，得先找租房子的資料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-14","sourceFront":"生活","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"很多大學生利用暑假去國外旅行或是學語言。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-09","sourceFront":"利用","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的家人非常關心我在國外的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-17","sourceFront":"關心","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣人在國外碰到問題時，可以立刻打0800-085-095「你幫我，你救我」這支電話求救。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-20","sourceFront":"求救","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在國外留學的時候，小史是我最好的兄弟，我們總是互相照顧、互相幫忙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-01","sourceFront":"兄弟","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在國外工作的那幾年，他學會了什麼問題都自己解決，不依靠別人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-23","sourceFront":"依靠","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在國外遇見好久沒聯絡的好友，是一件很開心的事情。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-13","sourceFront":"遇見","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了打開(to open up)國外市場，公司上頭決定增加網路銷售方面的經費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-23","sourceFront":"上頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"國外旅行時隨時攜帶護照、信用卡，可讓你玩得安心又順利。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-04","sourceFront":"攜帶","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到國外旅遊時身上別攜帶太多鈔票，否則錢丟了就麻煩了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-18","sourceFront":"否則","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"國外商品來到本國後，賣出的價錢往往比國外高出一兩成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-32","sourceFront":"成","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我考慮接受公司的安排，到國外協助市場調查工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-32","sourceFront":"考慮","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不少人利用新年期間到國外旅行，國內過年的氣氛就越來越淡了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-42","sourceFront":"氣氛","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這裡的資源不多，大部分的石油得從國外進口。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-03","sourceFront":"進口","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一個國家光是依靠免費簽證，是無法吸引國外遊客來旅行的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-32","sourceFront":"光是","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從國外坐飛機到臺灣來，有時需要轉機。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-46","sourceFront":"轉機","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他在國外旅行時因為簽證有問題，回國時間只好提前了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-18","sourceFront":"提前","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們公司在這次電子展共發表了九項新產品，並吸引不少國外客戶來參觀。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-13","sourceFront":"共","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他決定搬到國外去，所以打算出售臺灣的房屋。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-15","sourceFront":"出售","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這所國立大學獨特的教育風格吸引了不少國外學生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-08","sourceFront":"國立","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"要前往國外旅行，得先確認當地現在的氣候，好收拾行李。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-27","sourceFront":"前往","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"她的外語能力不錯，因此公司經常派她到國外出差。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-18","sourceFront":"派","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這臺食品加工設備的構造相當複雜，其中約三分之一的零件還是由國外進口。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-05","sourceFront":"由","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-2-22\",\"未来\",\"未來\",\"未来\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我的父母覺得出國念書才會有美好的未來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-22","sourceFront":"未來","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"沒有人能保證上了有名的大學，未來就一定快樂、幸福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-10","sourceFront":"保證","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"任何人都應該認真思考自己的未來，別糊里糊塗地過日子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-09","sourceFront":"思考","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有一份研究報告表示，對陌生環境適應能力越強的人，未來成功的機會也越高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-18","sourceFront":"陌生","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人人都希望自己的孩子有幸福的生活、美好的未來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-13","sourceFront":"人人","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對華人來說，把書念好才有美好的未來，這個傳統觀念在臺灣已經慢慢改變了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-14","sourceFront":"觀念","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"結婚之前，那對情侶認真規劃了未來的生活，沒想到結婚一個月之後就離婚了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-25","sourceFront":"之前","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"科學家在他的時代所努力的結果，都可能會在未來開花結果。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-31","sourceFront":"結果","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據氣象資料，這個颱風未來兩天會往西移動，週五起對台灣產生影響。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-27","sourceFront":"移動","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"教育是國家的根本，能改變國家的未來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-27","sourceFront":"根本","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L12-1-23\",\"经理\",\"經理\",\"经理\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我父親是保險公司的經理，要管理很多員工。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-25","sourceFront":"員工","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"為了做這個報告，經理已經跟我們開過三次會了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-26","sourceFront":"開會","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"張經理不但常加班，還要做市場研究，每天都忙得不得了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-29","sourceFront":"研究","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"他是廣告公司的經理，每天要做好多事，忙得不得了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-13","sourceFront":"做事","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我在車站遇到以前的同事，他現在是一家保險公司的經理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-02","sourceFront":"遇到","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下個星期我要和經理一起到美國去出差。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-08","sourceFront":"和","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老闆很滿意小陳的工作表現， 明年要請他當經理呢！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-24","sourceFront":"表現","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經理說，我們要一邊說笑話一邊介紹機器的功能，這樣子才賣得好","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-14","sourceFront":"這樣子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的新同事不但工作能力強， 也很負責，來公司沒多久就得到經理的肯定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-29","sourceFront":"肯定","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天開會時，經理提到公司打算做市場研究，希望大家下次能發表自己的想法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-05","sourceFront":"提到","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經理做事態度認真、負責，我從他身上