 shàngwǎng, kàn diànnǎo, wán shǒujī, yīnggāi qù yùndòng. Míngtiān wǒ yǒukòng, wǒmen kěyǐ yìqǐ qù qí jiǎotàchē.","english":"Don’t surf the internet, use the computer or play on the cell phone at home often. You should go exercise. I am available tomorrow. We can go ride bikes together.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 口(mouth) shouts 止(stop) at a 沓(pad) of feet → 踏(trample)."},{"key":"[\"B4L12-1-42\",\"郵票\",\"郵票\",\"邮票\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"紀念郵票一般都是以歷史上的大事或重要人物當作主題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-42","sourceFront":"郵票","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"作\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A skilled 亻(person) making the 乍(first) strike begins to 作(do) their craft."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"停\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A weary traveler 亻(person) pauses under a roadside 亭(pavilion) to rest: 停(suspend)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"怎麼\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"怎(how) + 麼(suffix) → 怎麼: the heart in 怎 asks 'how?' when you're baffled."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"護理師\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"護(protect) + 理(care) + 師(professional) → a professional who protects and cares for patients: nurse."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"靜\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"青(qīng) light rests as the 爭(dispute) fades → the room goes 靜(still)."}]}
